msgid "Potion Deleted in MAW"
msgstr "重置版已删除药水"

msgid "MAW Rules"
msgstr "MAW 重置版规则"

msgid "MAW rebalances monsters, items, skills and spells."
msgstr "MAW（Monster Arts and Wonders，重置）重置版重新平衡了怪物、物品、技能与法术。"

msgid "Universe of Might and Magic"
msgstr "魔法门重生"

msgid ""
"An item's description shows in grey what crafting would add to it next, and its bonus power (rulesets with crafting, such as MAW)."
msgstr "物品描述会用灰色显示下一次制作会为它增加什么，以及它的加成强度（适用于带制作系统的规则集，例如重置版）。"

msgid ""
"A button under the minimap opens a log of recent hits, each with its damage steps; with MAW games, only in MAW games outside the MM9 world."
msgstr "在小地图下方添加一个按钮，可打开最近命中的记录，并列出每次伤害的计算步骤；对于重置版游戏，仅在 MM9 世界之外的重置版游戏中可用。"

msgid "MAW games"
msgstr "重置版游戏"

msgid "MAW"
msgstr "MAW 重置版"

msgid ""
"The game speed while fast mode is on. Its key (F2 unless rebound) turns fast mode on and off; the Cycle game speed key (unbound unless set) steps through 1x and these speeds and sets this one."
msgstr "快速模式开启时的游戏速度。其按键（未改动时为 F2）用于开启和关闭快速模式；“循环切换游戏速度”按键（未设置时为空）会在 1 倍和这些速度之间依次切换，并把当前速度设为此项。"

msgid "Cycle game speed"
msgstr "循环切换游戏速度"

msgid "Cycle Speed"
msgstr "切换速度"

msgid "{name} gains an item!"
msgstr "{name}获得了一件物品！"
